#: scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 968b85731085a48e12a21b8364e88ddaef8c5d192b481bcf5f3787efcf9159fb
#. default-sha256: ae70d35737726a70b17f9b590edaf49074785e46197aee088adb474ce29fc818
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_666D8E7B_F0D9_49F6_8DD7_BE30ACD02278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The "
"only sounds that could be heard in the dark corridors were the sharp pitter-patter of the rain, "
"his footsteps, and his breathing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫——漫步"
"在夜色长廊之下，⟪k:17⟫能听到的只有清脆的雨滴声，⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫以及，⟪k:20⟫梅尔自己沉重的鼻息和脚步"
"声。"

#: scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b42ec6673b08fd36cff56877ed590408a72dd1c52186bd4714b7f6c12c5fad7
#. default-sha256: 15c3481fa00e2da6ad737f985d6be1d7c70dccc51173aa05313551602c42f640
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3E02E646_1ECF_4E68_A46C_A4416474A5CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was intimately familiar with the layout of the house, that night, the hallways "
"felt like an endless labyrinth veiled in shadows."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫平时司空见惯的走廊，⟪k:1⟫现在却像没有出口的迷宫一般，⟪k:2⟫尽头湮没在黑暗之中。"

#: scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 694bbc302440b0a07de6a1d5d21fdd30366692f7a3f6d28c4111f6db9dc3119a
#. default-sha256: 4d6d7fd24e274a555cc84e108a47b629419c5fbba2b6caf5dcef070b19b87099
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2DD2A30_D607_470F_A060_BC5B1E78EC2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No moonlight shone through the windows, so he naturally found himself moving cautiously, "
"despite being in his own residence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫虽说是自家的宅邸，⟪k:1⟫但窗外没有一丝月光。⟪k:2⟫不得已，他只能摸索着四周，⟪k:3⟫战战兢兢地向前"
"迈步。"

#: scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8db75f57aafc4a66987d3cdca5629bffc6597276f05f71988dd4ff73192302ad
#. default-sha256: 86a6c18409746b0234058b3418a1b100b959823c11c5ed7558a0672f053f3fb4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75F434A0_B751_460F_A1DC_1D339A07B2A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Keeping the palm of his hand pressed up against the chilly wall, he put one foot in front of "
"the other."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫指尖滑过冰冷的墙壁，⟪k:1⟫脚下笨重地一步，又一步，⟪k:2⟫穿过漆黑的长廊。"

#: scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7933103be405d766409fd14433aa1eced89767692d51efb859a98accfd0526b
#. default-sha256: 880ae9081c5e26423e0c967fecceb3c6ca554b8bf0aa371a13d6f064642ed53c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC7DC57_B9A8_43A5_98C4_9F19FFEE95A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to where was he supposed to head?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mell, of course, had no way of answering that "
"question himself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫究竟，会被引向何方呢？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫恐怕连他自己，⟪k:3⟫都无法回答。"

#: scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0121998fafe6d2caf27aaefe3835ab00927a280087458addbfbdedc8a51f62d
#. default-sha256: c01f36036dbf6a9864c282d180bf29db039736ff6811622b47bc7efd30533fd3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB4A4C67_7CE2_42EA_9CCB_3459BDF23D1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If he had anything... ⟪k:1⟫it was guidance from above—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the path to his destination "
"lit by flashes of lightning."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫硬要说的话……⟪k:1⟫也许指引他的是这条长长的走廊，⟪k:2⟫也许是前方不时浮现的闪电。"

#: scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7f4e15e88f148718418f6e497816386a1c87af626ef8da7357006a21e7c43cb
#. default-sha256: 0b3fa93ad74c65af481033d7819211924e64b5871bc8cd556a38e2d5ca086c3d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_815C4AA0_5DB1_406F_82A1_1EFD1D08404F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps there was something else leading him along."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫又或许，⟪k:1⟫是冥冥之中，⟪k:2⟫无形地牵着他手的什么力量吧……"

#: scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45c4917e2c35c2d4905d063bc6a5f4902eb33697a1318c1b22fa51ddeb5fb16d
#. default-sha256: 944d4aba664782110b4a872d531a589155b7674db9b4baeeea04c825dc51c8ea
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A75F580_A5E3_48EC_AA57_2BFAE51E1CEB"
msgid ""
